    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Active Product2 records referencing inactive blng__RevenueRecognitionRule__c.
Why it matters: Revenue for these products falls back to defaults instead of the intended schedule. Recognized revenue lands in the wrong period, breaking ASC 606 / IFRS 15 compliance.
